    "content": "<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-container {\"block_id\":\"7f92_35\",\"columns\":1,\"contwidFull\":\"full\",\"align\":\"full\",\"containerWide\":{\"md\":\"83\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"sm\":\"100\",\"xs\":\"100\"},\"containerFull\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"colDir\":\"c100\",\"currentID\":40631,\"NormalBg\":{\"openBg\":1,\"bgType\":\"\",\"videoSource\":\"local\",\"bgDefaultColor\":\"\",\"bgGradient\":\"\",\"isCustom\":\"fpp\"},\"Margin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"autoset\":true},\"unit\":\"px\"},\"Padding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"},\"flexDirection\":{\"md\":\"column\",\"xs\":\"column\",\"sm\":\"column\"},\"flexAlign\":{\"md\":\"flex-start\",\"sm\":\"\",\"xs\":\"\"},\"flexJustify\":{\"md\":\"center\",\"sm\":\"\",\"xs\":\"\"},\"flexGap\":{\"md\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":\"24\",\"xs\":\"24\"},\"flexwrap\":{\"md\":\"nowrap\"},\"selectedLayout\":\"flex\",\"isrootContainer\":true,\"nxtcontType\":true} -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph {\"block_id\":\"0e14_35\",\"Showtitle\":false,\"title\":\"\",\"exproCnt\":\"A brand refresh is more than just a new logo or color palette; it represents a company's evolution and adaptability in a changing marketplace. As consumer preferences shift and competition intensifies, a refresh can help a brand remain relevant and appealing. The worth of a brand refresh lies in its ability to rejuvenate customer perceptions and drive engagement.\",\"content\":\"A brand refresh is more than just a new logo or color palette; it represents a company's evolution and adaptability in a changing marketplace. As consumer preferences shift and competition intensifies, a refresh can help a brand remain relevant and appealing. The worth of a brand refresh lies in its ability to rejuvenate customer perceptions and drive engagement.\",\"alignment\":{\"md\":\"left\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"dropCap\":true,\"captShadow\":{\"openShadow\":0,\"inset\":\"\",\"horizontal\":2,\"vertical\":3,\"blur\":2,\"spread\":0,\"color\":0,\"typeShadow\":\"text-shadow\"},\"tcapspac\":\"12\",\"dcapTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"globalMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalPadding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"}} --><div class=\"tpgb-pro-paragraph tpgb-block-0e14_6afe816154b0c585f405f024\"><p class=\"pro-paragraph-inner\">A brand refresh is more than just a new logo or color palette; it represents a company's evolution and adaptability in a changing marketplace. As consumer preferences shift and competition intensifies, a refresh can help a brand remain relevant and appealing. The worth of a brand refresh lies in its ability to rejuvenate customer perceptions and drive engagement.</p></div><!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph {\"block_id\":\"44e6_35\",\"Showtitle\":false,\"title\":\"\",\"exproCnt\":\"However, the financial implications of a brand refresh should not be underestimated. Companies often invest considerable resources into rebranding efforts, from market research to design execution. This investment can yield substantial returns if managed effectively, enhancing customer loyalty and increasing market share.\",\"content\":\"However, the financial implications of a brand refresh should not be underestimated. Companies often invest considerable resources into rebranding efforts, from market research to design execution. This investment can yield substantial returns if managed effectively, enhancing customer loyalty and increasing market share.\",\"alignment\":{\"md\":\"left\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"globalMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalPadding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"}} --><div class=\"tpgb-pro-paragraph tpgb-block-44e6_6afe816154b0c585f405f024\"><p class=\"pro-paragraph-inner\">However, the financial implications of a brand refresh should not be underestimated. Companies often invest considerable resources into rebranding efforts, from market research to design execution. This investment can yield substantial returns if managed effectively, enhancing customer loyalty and increasing market share.</p></div><!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-blockquote {\"block_id\":\"e86a_35\",\"style\":\"style-2\",\"content\":\"A brand is not just what you say it is; it’s what they say it is.\",\"authorName\":\"- Marty Neumeier\",\"contentAlignment\":\"left\",\"typography\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"authorTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"textNormalColor\":\"\",\"quoteColor\":\"\",\"boxPadding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"32\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"80\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"24\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"bottom\":\"24\",\"right\":\"24\",\"left\":\"80\"}},\"boxMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"},\"borderNormal\":{\"openBorder\":0,\"type\":\"\",\"color\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dtpgb-C21)\",\"width\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"right\":\"\"},\"unit\":\"\"},\"globalBorderColor\":\"\",\"globalBorder\":\"\"},\"borderRadius\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"xs\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalBorderRadius\":{\"md\":8,\"sm\":8,\"xs\":8},\"globalBorderRadiusFallback\":{\"md\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"sm\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"xs\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\"}},\"catBg\":{\"openBg\":1,\"bgType\":\"color\",\"videoSource\":\"local\",\"bgDefaultColor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.04)\",\"bgGradient\":\"\",\"isCustom\":\"fpp\"},\"catBoxShadow\":{\"openShadow\":0,\"inset\":0,\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":4,\"blur\":8,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.40)\"},\"catBoxShadowHover\":{\"openShadow\":true,\"inset\":0,\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":4,\"blur\":8,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.40)\",\"globalShadow\":\"4\"},\"quoteIcon\":\"fas fa-quote-right\",\"qiconSize\":{\"md\":\"30\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"iconLoffset\":{\"md\":\"32\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"iconToffset\":{\"md\":\"40\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":\"24\"},\"globalMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"tp-blockquote tpgb-relative-block tpgb-block-e86a_6afe816154b0c585f405f024\"><div class=\"tpgb-blockquote-inner tpgb-quote-style-2\"><span class=\"tpgb-quote-left\"><i class=\"fas fa-quote-right\"></i></span><blockquote class=\"tpgb-quote-text\"><div class=\"quote-text-wrap\"><span class=\"quote-text\">A brand is not just what you say it is; it’s what they say it is.</span></div><div class=\"tpgb-quote-author\">- Marty Neumeier</div></blockquote></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-blockquote -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph {\"block_id\":\"7a22_35\",\"title\":\"Understanding Mental Health and Well-being:-\",\"titleTag\":\"h4\",\"exproCnt\":\"The Importance of Brand Perception\",\"content\":\"The Importance of Brand Perception\",\"alignment\":{\"md\":\"left\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"titleTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"titleBtmSpace\":{\"md\":\"12\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"globalPadding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"}} --><div class=\"tpgb-pro-paragraph tpgb-block-7a22_6afe816154b0c585f405f024\"><h4 class=\"pro-heading-inner\">The Importance of Brand Perception</h4></div><!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-stylist-list {\"block_id\":\"c301_35\",\"listsRepeater\":[{\"_key\":\"0\",\"description\":\"Increased customer loyalty and trust\",\"selectIcon\":\"fontawesome\",\"iconFontawesome\":\"fas fa-check-circle\"},{\"_key\":\"1\",\"description\":\"Enhanced market differentiation\",\"selectIcon\":\"fontawesome\",\"iconFontawesome\":\"fas fa-check-circle\"},{\"_key\":\"2\",\"description\":\"Improved employee engagement and pride in the brand\",\"selectIcon\":\"fontawesome\",\"iconFontawesome\":\"fas fa-check-circle\"}],\"listSpaceBetween\":{\"md\":\"12\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"textPadding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"},\"textBg\":{\"openBg\":0,\"bgType\":\"color\",\"videoSource\":\"local\",\"bgDefaultColor\":\"\",\"bgGradient\":\"\",\"isCustom\":\"fpp\"},\"globalMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"globalPadding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"}} -->\n<ul><li>Increased customer loyalty and trust</li><li>Enhanced market differentiation</li><li>Improved employee engagement and pride in the brand</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-stylist-list -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-container {\"block_id\":\"9786_35\",\"columns\":1,\"contentWidth\":\"full\",\"align\":\"full\",\"containerFull\":{\"md\":\"100\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"colDir\":\"r100\",\"currentID\":40631,\"Margin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"autoset\":true},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"autoset\":true}},\"Padding\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\"},\"flexDirection\":{\"md\":\"row\",\"xs\":\"column\",\"sm\":\"row\"},\"flexAlign\":{\"md\":\"center\",\"sm\":\"\",\"xs\":\"\"},\"flexGap\":{\"md\":\"24\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":\"24\"},\"flexwrap\":{\"md\":\"nowrap\"},\"flexChild\":[{\"_key\":\"iei6\",\"flexShrink\":{\"md\":\"\"},\"flexGrow\":{\"md\":\"\"},\"flexBasis\":{\"md\":\"50\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"flexselfAlign\":{\"md\":\"\"},\"flexOrder\":{\"md\":\"\"}},{\"_key\":\"cvi9\",\"flexShrink\":{\"md\":\"\"},\"flexGrow\":{\"md\":\"\"},\"flexBasis\":{\"md\":\"50\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"flexselfAlign\":{\"md\":\"\"},\"flexOrder\":{\"md\":\"\"}}],\"showchild\":true,\"selectedLayout\":\"flex\",\"isrootContainer\":true} -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-image {\"block_id\":\"b224_35\",\"tImg\":{\"url\":\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/558eed416c8bb0b5.webp\",\"sizes\":{\"thumbnail\":{\"height\":150,\"width\":150,\"url\":\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/558eed416c8bb0b5.webp\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"medium\":{\"height\":223,\"width\":300,\"url\":\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/558eed416c8bb0b5.webp\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"full\":{\"url\":\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/558eed416c8bb0b5.webp\",\"height\":336,\"width\":452,\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}},\"caption\":\"\",\"id\":0,\"alt\":\"\"},\"iWidth\":{\"md\":\"100\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"imWidth\":{\"md\":\"100\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"iHeig\":{\"md\":\"336\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"xs\":\"300\",\"sm\":\"300\"},\"imgFit\":{\"md\":\"cover\"},\"ibrad\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"xs\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalBorderRadius\":{\"md\":8,\"sm\":8,\"xs\":8},\"globalBorderRadiusFallback\":{\"md\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"sm\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"xs\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\"}},\"globalBRadius\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"xs\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalBorderRadius\":{\"md\":8,\"sm\":8,\"xs\":8},\"globalBorderRadiusFallback\":{\"md\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"sm\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"xs\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\"}},\"globalBShadow\":{\"openShadow\":true,\"inset\":0,\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":4,\"blur\":8,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.40)\",\"globalShadow\":\"5\"},\"globalBShadowHover\":{\"openShadow\":true,\"inset\":0,\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":4,\"blur\":8,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.40)\",\"globalShadow\":\"6\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-tpgb-tp-image tpgb-image tpgb-block-b224_35\"><figure class=\"tpgb-figure\"><img src=\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/558eed416c8bb0b5.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"tpgb-img-inner wp-image-46791\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-image -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph {\"block_id\":\"fd1c_35\",\"title\":\"Whether you're a psychology enthusiast, a student of the mind, or simply curious about human behaviour\",\"titleTag\":\"p\",\"exproCnt\":\"When executed strategically, a brand refresh can lead to a noticeable shift in consumer sentiment and behavior. It is essential for businesses to conduct thorough research to understand their audience's needs and preferences before initiating a refresh. This insight will guide the branding process, ensuring that the new identity resonates with existing customers while attracting new ones.\",\"content\":\"When executed strategically, a brand refresh can lead to a noticeable shift in consumer sentiment and behavior. It is essential for businesses to conduct thorough research to understand their audience's needs and preferences before initiating a refresh. This insight will guide the branding process, ensuring that the new identity resonates with existing customers while attracting new ones.\",\"alignment\":{\"md\":\"left\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"titleTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"titleBtmSpace\":{\"md\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"}} --><div class=\"tpgb-pro-paragraph tpgb-block-fd1c_6afe816154b0c585f405f024\"><p class=\"pro-paragraph-inner\">When executed strategically, a brand refresh can lead to a noticeable shift in consumer sentiment and behavior. It is essential for businesses to conduct thorough research to understand their audience's needs and preferences before initiating a refresh. This insight will guide the branding process, ensuring that the new identity resonates with existing customers while attracting new ones.</p></div><!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-container -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph {\"block_id\":\"3a11_35\",\"Showtitle\":false,\"title\":\"\",\"exproCnt\":\"Ultimately, the worth of a brand refresh is measured not only in immediate financial gains but also in long-term brand equity. Brands that invest in refreshing their image and messaging can better navigate market challenges and seize opportunities for growth. A successful refresh can create a renewed sense of purpose and direction, driving the brand forward into the future.\",\"content\":\"Ultimately, the worth of a brand refresh is measured not only in immediate financial gains but also in long-term brand equity. Brands that invest in refreshing their image and messaging can better navigate market challenges and seize opportunities for growth. A successful refresh can create a renewed sense of purpose and direction, driving the brand forward into the future.\",\"alignment\":{\"md\":\"left\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"globalMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"}}} --><div class=\"tpgb-pro-paragraph tpgb-block-3a11_6afe816154b0c585f405f024\"><p class=\"pro-paragraph-inner\">Ultimately, the worth of a brand refresh is measured not only in immediate financial gains but also in long-term brand equity. Brands that invest in refreshing their image and messaging can better navigate market challenges and seize opportunities for growth. A successful refresh can create a renewed sense of purpose and direction, driving the brand forward into the future.</p></div><!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-container -->\n"
}
